# Ember & Ash — what each section of the board should hold.
#
# These were typed on the command line every round, so in practice only the
# deck sections got claimed: 01 to 09 went uncounted for weeks while every
# run reported a clean board. Keeping them here means the whole board is
# checked by default and a change to any section has to be made here too.
#
# A bare count means everything the section holds; a type prefix — canvas,
# document, sticky — pins one kind, which a section holding both needs.

01=canvas:1
01=document:1
02=canvas:2
03=canvas:5
04=document:2
05=canvas:2
07=canvas:1
07=document:1
08=canvas:3
09=canvas:2
10=36
11=12
12=4
13=9
14=document:2
15=canvas:8
